acme.validation.create.ticker.message = Ticker must match the format XX00-XXXXX (2 letters, 2 digits, dash, 5–10 alphanumeric characters)
acme.validation.text.message=Text must not be blank and must be at most 255 characters long
acme.validation.header.message=Header must not be blank and must be at most 75 characters long
acme.validation.part.currency.message = The currency must be EUR
acme.validation.invention.parts.message = The invention must have at least one part
acme.validation.invention.dates.message = To publish an invention, both dates must be in the future
acme.validation.invention.ticker.non-unique = The ticker is already used by another invention
acme.validation.invention.monthsActive.message = The active months cannot be negative or null
acme.validation.invention.cost.message = The cost must be a positive value in EUR
acme.validation.strategy.ticker.non-unique = The ticker is already used by another strategy
acme.validation.campaign.ticker.non-unique = The ticker is already used by another campaign
acme.validation.campaign.milestones.message = The campaign must have at least one milestone
acme.validation.campaign.dates.message = To publish an campaign, both dates must be in the future
acme.validation.campaign.monthsActive.message = The active months cannot be negative or null
acme.validation.strategy.parts.message = The strategy must have at least one part
acme.validation.strategy.dates.message = To publish a strategy, both dates must be in the future
acme.validation.auditReport.auditSections.message = The audit report must have at least one part
acme.validation.auditReport.dates.message = To publish an audit report, both dates must be in the future
acme.validation.auditReport.ticker.non-unique = The ticker is already used by another audit report
acme.validation.auditReport.monthsActive.message = The active months cannot be negative or null
acme.validation.auditReport.start-before-end.message = The start date cannot be later than the end date
acme.validation.auditReport.start-end-not-equal.message = The start date and end date cannot be equal
acme.validation.auditSection.hours.max-digits.message = Must have a maximum of 6 digits.
acme.validation.sponsorship.missing-donations.message = Sponsorships must include at least one donation
acme.validation.sponsorship.invalid-date.message= Sponsorship end date must be after the start date
